%% Weekend 2.0 - Voice request flow on Google Cloud (DESIGN.md section 5.3, v0.2.0)
sequenceDiagram
  participant P as PWA
  participant A as API Cloud Run
  participant S as STT local or Google STT
  participant L as Claude Vertex AI
  participant V as TTS local or Google TTS
  P->>A: upload audio clip via entry node
  A->>S: transcribe
  S-->>A: text
  A->>L: same flow as text
  L-->>A: answer text sentence by sentence
  A->>V: synthesize each sentence
  V-->>A: audio chunks
  A-->>P: audio and text
